# `composer.lock` is deliberately TRACKED. This is a library, but the lock is
# only ever consumed by this repository's own CI and dev installs — Composer
# ignores a dependency's lock file entirely, so committing it costs consumers
# nothing. It keeps the three PHP versions in CI on one known-good dependency
# set instead of resolving fresh (and differently) on every run.
# It is kept out of the dist archive via `.gitattributes`.
